  "description": "Big Tech refers to the large, influential technology companies that dominate the digital economy, such as Google, Facebook, Amazon, and Apple. The meme targets Google as a representative of Big Tech, accusing it of controlling information. Understanding the concept of Big Tech and its role in modern society is essential to interpret the meme's critique of corporate power over information.",
